{"schema":1,"id":"lantern","title":"How one scene program becomes a page, pictures and a trace","lang":"en","sources":["https://github.com/ivarvong/lantern","https://github.com/ivarvong/lantern/blob/2c7bad5/src/scene.ts"],"settings":[],"cases":[{"values":{},"name":"","duration":114.833,"steps":[{"step":"model","title":"One program names the steps and draws their pictures","line":"Follow this.step and this.play from the code to the stage.","caption":"How can one scene make both an interactive page and the stills and trace that inspect it? In demo.ts, construct calls this.step to name each idea and this.play to draw it on the stage beside the code. The engine runs that ordinary method; later steps follow its frames into the page, SVG and trace rather than interpreting a separate lesson document.","start":0,"end":22.9,"hold":9.7,"state":{},"changed":{},"picture":"Code, 9 lines; A small stage beside the code, running the same program; On the small stage, the circle the program drew, turned into a square by its last play; 5 labels. Focused: 7: await this.play(new Transform(dot, new Square())).","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                                                                ┌──────────────────────────┐\n│                                                                │                          │\n│                                                                │         ╭──────╮         │\n│                                                                │         │      │         │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │         │      │         │\n│  │ class Demo extends Scene {                               │  │         ╰──────╯         │\n│  │                                                          │  │                          │\n│  │   async construct() {                                    │  step 'after'               │\n│  │     const dot = new Circle({ radius: 0.6 });             │▌ └──────────────────────────┘\n│  │     await this.step('before', { caption: 'One idea.' });─step 1\n│  │     await this.play(new FadeIn(dot));                   ─play 1\n│  │     await this.step('after', { caption: 'The next idea.' step 2\n│  ▌     await this.play(new Transform(dot, new Square()));  ─play 2\n│  ▌   }                                                      │▌\n│  │                                                          │\n│  │ }                                                        │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│"},{"step":"objects","title":"A Scene owns mobjects, plays animations and emits frames to a sink","line":"Three sinks turn the same frames into a view, SVG or a trace.","caption":"Each walked edge is one relation: a Scene owns mobjects, plays animations between endpoints fixed when they begin, and emits frames to a sink. The three sinks drawn out of Sink turn the same frames into a browser view, an SVG string or an inspection trace.","start":22.9,"end":40.167,"hold":30.967,"state":{"walks":[{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Mobject","edge":"rel:Scene->Mobject#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Animation","edge":"rel:Scene->Animation#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Sink","edge":"rel:Scene->Sink#0"}]},"changed":{"walks":{"after":[{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Mobject","edge":"rel:Scene->Mobject#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Animation","edge":"rel:Scene->Animation#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Sink","edge":"rel:Scene->Sink#0"}]}},"picture":"Class diagram: 4 classes, 3 relationships; Three lines fanning out of Sink to its three kinds; 3 labels. Note: “endpoints fixed at begin()” beside Animation interpolate(); travelled: Scene → Mobject: owns; Scene → Animation: plays; Scene → Sink: emits.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│     ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     │                                                    │\n│     ───────────────────────────────────┌─────────────┐────\n│     ───────────────────────────────────│───────────────────DomSink: browser view\n│     │                 ┌──────────────────────────────┌─────StringSink: SVG string\n│     ──────────────────│──────────────────────────────│──── │\n│     ──────────────────│────────────────└─────────────└─────TraceSink: inspection trace\n│     ──────────────────│────────────────│──────────────────\n│     │                 │                ┌─────────────┐   │\n│     ──────────────────│────────────────│─────────────│────\n│     ──────────────────│─────┌────┐────────────────────────\n│     │                 │─────│────│─────│──────       │   │\n│     ──────────────────│─────└────┘─────│─────────────│────\n│     ────┌─────────────┐───────────────────────────────────\n│     │   │    ─────    │                └─────────────┘   │\n│     ───────────────────────────────────┘──────────────────\n│     ────│─────────────│────────────────┌─────────────┐────\n│     │   │──────       │     ┌────┐     │    ───────  │   │\n│     ────│─────────────│─────│────│────────────────────────\n│     ────└─────────────┘─────└────┘─────│─────────────│────\n│     │                                ─────────────────── │\n│     ─────────────────────────────endpoints fixed at begin()\n│     └────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"step":"points","title":"A circle is 13 points: 4 cubic Béziers","line":"Anchors and handles: every shape and glyph is stored this way.","caption":"Every shape, glyph and imported diagram is stored as cubic Bézier points, like the anchors and handles drawn on this circle. The zoom onto Mobject is the camera: it changes what the stage shows, and no point in the diagram moves.","start":40.167,"end":55.567,"hold":43.9,"state":{"walks":[{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Mobject","edge":"rel:Scene->Mobject#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Animation","edge":"rel:Scene->Animation#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Sink","edge":"rel:Scene->Sink#0"}]},"changed":{},"picture":"Class diagram: 4 classes, 3 relationships; A circle of radius 1 as 4 cubic Béziers: anchors as large dots, handles as small dots joined to their anchors; Code, 6 lines. Note: “points: Float32Array” beside Mobject points style; focused: Mobject points style. New in this step: A circle of radius 1 as 4 cubic Béziers: anchors as large dots, handles as small dots joined to their anchors; Code, 6 lines.","drawing":"                                           │\n────────────────────────────────────────────\n                ┌───────────────────┐      │\n────────────────│───────────────────│───────\n┌───────┐       │                   │      │\n│───────│───────────────────────────────────\n│       │       ─────────────────────      │ ╭───●────●────●──╮\n└───────┘       │  ──────           │      │ │                │\n────────────────└───────────────────┘─────── ●┐               ●┐\n                │                          │ ││               ││┌─────────────────────────────┐\n────────────────│─────────────────────────── ││               │││                             │\n                ┌───────────────────┐      │ ●┘               ●┘│  circle.subpaths[0]  // radius\n────────────────│───────────────────│─────── ││               │││  [ 1.00,  0.00]  anchor     │\n                │                   │      │ ●┘               ●┘│  [ 1.00, -0.55]  handle     │\n┌───────┐─────────────────────────────────── │                │ │  [ 0.55, -1.00]  handle     │\n│───────│───────│ ───────           │      │ ╰───●────●────●──╯ │  [ 0.00, -1.00]  anchor     │\n│───────│───────│───────────────────│───────                    │  …                          │\n└───────┘       │                   │      │                    └─────────────────────────────┘\n────────────────────────────────────────────\n                ┌────────────────────┐     │\n────────────────points: Float32Array─│──────\n                └────────────────────┘     │\n────────────────┌───────────────────┐───────\n                │    ───────────    │      │\n┌───────┐────────────────────────────      │\n│───────│───────────────────────────────────\n└───────┘       │ ───────────────   │      │"},{"step":"clock","title":"Every sink gets the same frames, 1/30 s apart","line":"The browser waits for display ticks; the trace takes all at once.","caption":"Scene time advances by a fixed dt per frame, whichever sink is attached. The browser sink waits for a display tick before each frame while the trace sink takes them all at once, so both see the same scene times on the ruler.","start":55.567,"end":71.7,"hold":60.5,"state":{"walks":[{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Mobject","edge":"rel:Scene->Mobject#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Animation","edge":"rel:Scene->Animation#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Sink","edge":"rel:Scene->Sink#0"},{"step":"clock","from":"Clock","to":"Browser","edge":"edge:Clock->Browser#0"},{"step":"clock","from":"Clock","to":"Trace","edge":"edge:Clock->Trace#0"}]},"changed":{"walks":{"before":[{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Mobject","edge":"rel:Scene->Mobject#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Animation","edge":"rel:Scene->Animation#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Sink","edge":"rel:Scene->Sink#0"}],"after":[{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Mobject","edge":"rel:Scene->Mobject#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Animation","edge":"rel:Scene->Animation#0"},{"step":"objects","from":"Scene","to":"Sink","edge":"rel:Scene->Sink#0"},{"step":"clock","from":"Clock","to":"Browser","edge":"edge:Clock->Browser#0"},{"step":"clock","from":"Clock","to":"Trace","edge":"edge:Clock->Trace#0"}]}},"picture":"Flowchart: 6 nodes, 5 links; 12 labels. Travelled: Fixed dt loop → Browser sink; Fixed dt loop → S